>=20
> Partially restructures _snd_emu10k1_audigy_init_efx() and
> _snd_emu10k1_init_efx() functions.
>=20
> Removes useless casting (void *) from value returned by kcalloc;
> see Documentation/CodingStyle, Chap 14.
>=20
> Signed-off-by: Geyslan G. Bem <geyslan@gmail.com>

This causes the compiler error.

sound/pci/emu10k1/emufx.c:1190:26: error: expected expression before =E2=
=80=98)=E2=80=99 token
  icode->gpr_map =3D (__user) kcalloc(512 + 256 + 256 + 2 * 1024,

So, the straight cast only with __user isn't possible.  It's a sort of
modifier (like "const"), and it must be always with the real type to
cast.

Please do the reasonable tests before submitting any patches.


thanks,

Takashi

